      "92cac67e-cfc1-43d9-828c-a3d15756cff6",
      "77d7219f-e99f-4977-b70c-5e4ad8f2a469",
      null,
      "chapter",
      2,
      "Part 2: The Two Eras: 104 Baseline to 105 Cryptographic Integrity",
      "Contrasts the foundational 104 format era with the hardened 105 Integrity Era, detailing the tri-format taxonomy across homogeneous tables (104/105), configuration manifests (104a/105a), and single-file bundles (104db/105db). Clarifies the architectural role of MFDB as a multi-file orchestration layer that operates over individual format files rather than existing as an independent container format. Transitions to the physical data layout that underpins BEJSON's deterministic speed and context window compression.",
      null,
      "planned",
