      "chapter",
      4,
      "Part 4: MFDB v1.40 Orchestration: Serverless Referential Integrity",
      "Explores the MFDB v1.40 orchestration layer, breaking down how a centralized 104a manifest coordinates distributed 105 entity tables via bidirectional Parent_Hierarchy links and foreign key relationships. Demonstrates strict referential integrity enforcement across cascade, restrict, and set-null mutation plans with zero-daemon runtime overhead and strict sub-50MB resident memory bounds. Concludes the series with production integration guidelines and real-world deployment patterns for AI agent toolchains.",
